      "message": "refactor(state): migrate NotificationSettingsScreen to a Cubit (#4749)\n\nMove the notification settings UI state off ConsumerStatefulWidget + setState\nonto NotificationSettingsCubit (Page/View split). The Cubit owns the persisted\nNotificationPreferences plus the local push/sound/vibration toggles and\nload/update/reset. The Page (ConsumerWidget) bridges the prefs service into the\nBlocProvider, re-keyed on the service since it watches authServiceProvider.\n\nmarkAllAsRead stays a bridge-level action (it uses the separate, auth-nullable\nnotification repository) per the #4744 scope decision, so its success/failure\nsnackbars are unchanged. The existing widget test passes unmodified (behavior\nparity); adds bloc_test coverage for load / persistence / local toggles / reset.\n\nFirst slice of #4744 (Riverpod->BLoC) · Part of #4338 (Wave 2).",
